(
    title: "Fatal Run",
    developer: Some("Sculptured Software"),
    description: Some("The player races an anti-radiation vaccine across 32 stages of ruined, post-apocalyptic highway, blasting and swerving past enemy cars against a relentless countdown — arrive too late and the waiting townsfolk explode. Cash banked between runs buys repairs, armour and engine upgrades, while pickups like nitro, oil slicks, weapons and collision-proof \"death crystals\" keep the car alive; passwords carry progress onward."),
